			"formalist": {
				"type": "score",
				"instructions": "`chapter` is a passage of a novel of some 3,000 words. Read it as a critic of form would: one who weighs the shape of the sentences, the handling of point of view and time, the pattern of the whole, and cares nothing for the moral or the message. What is it to such a critic?",
